<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Totta/Pinto banks in US share offer-paper.</title>
<headline>Portugal Totta/Pinto banks in US share offer-paper.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Pinto e Sotto Mayor and Banco Totta e Acores made a joint launch in New York on Thursday of $250 million of preference shares, the financial daily Diario Economico reported.</p>
<p>It was not immediately possible to confirm the report with officials at either of the Champalimaud group banks.</p>
<p>The daily said the offer was made through a jointly-owned subsidiary of the two banks, Pinto e Totta. No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>--Lisbon burea 3511-3150035</p>
